Parseomatic bundles the following third-party assets:

Material Design Icons (https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/)
  The `sword` and `bow-arrow` glyph outlines used for role icons in the
  Overview players table (src/ui/widgets/role-icon.ts), and the
  `sword-cross` / `heart-plus` / `grave-stone` / `shoe-print` / `chart-timeline`
  / `head-remove` (Nerd Fonts aliases `nf-md-grave_stone` / `nf-md-shoe_print` /
  `nf-md-chart_timeline` / `nf-md-head_remove`) toolbar icons for the Damage /
  Healing / Deaths / Movement / Timeline / Interrupts views (index.html), and
  the `filter-variant` glyph used for the Timeline view's per-lane ability
  filter (src/ui/widgets/timeline-lanes.ts).
  Copyright Pictogrammers contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Octicons (https://primer.style/octicons/)
  The `plug` glyph outline (Nerd Fonts alias `nf-oct-plug`) used for the
  toolbar's "open data folder" button (index.html).
  Copyright GitHub, Inc.
  Licensed under the MIT License (https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT).

Font Awesome Free (https://fontawesome.com)
  The `bandage` glyph outline (Nerd Fonts alias `nf-fa-bandage`) used for
  the Damage Taken character view's toolbar icon, and the `video` glyph
  outline (Nerd Fonts alias `nf-fa-video_camera`) used for the Replay
  view's toolbar icon (index.html).
  Copyright Fonticons, Inc.
  Icons licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
